    "updated_at": "2025-06-16T17:33:43Z",
    "body": "This should all follow from https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#create-an-element-for-the-token looking at the parent element when creating a new element in the parser. Coupled with step 7 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#html-fragment-parsing-algorithm setting up the root element correctly for fragment parsing.\n\nSo it seems all we need here are tests, unless you found an issue with the specification you didn't specify?\n\n@ja-y-son thanks for writing https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/53171. I'll try to review that tomorrow.",
