    "updated_at": "2025-06-16T17:50:06Z",
    "body": "I just found that the intended behavior of setting `CustomElementRegistry` is outlined in [the spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#custom-elements-api) already, so I think we're good with the spec.\n\nWPT wise, I realized the test I wrote didn't test against the mentioned buggy behavior (I didn't attempt to set element that wasn't defined in the custom registry in innerHTML), so I'll update it today to make sure we catch the edge cases. \n\n",
